            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.4.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>27.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Fixed</h2>
<ul>
<li>After a restart of the Mac, Hachibu takes up sailing where it left it. Before, it asked for your limit first and the battery charged for a minute or two before the hold was back.</li>
</ul>
<p><a href="https://github.com/hammadmo/hachibu/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">Every version's changes</a></p>
]]></description>
