            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.4.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>27.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Fixed</h2>
<ul>
<li>Changing the sailing range or heat protection in Settings takes effect within a second, not up to twenty seconds later.</li>
<li>Running Hachibu from the command line no longer asks for permission to send notifications.</li>
</ul>
<p><a href="https://github.com/hammadmo/hachibu/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">Every version's changes</a></p>
]]></description>
